{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X对人物心理转折的因果解释不如Y充分，尤其是人物为什么反复动摇、为什么最终决定继续生活，Y用完整语句交代得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点加亮和感受按音乐时机出现的安排，更适合观众一边听一边扫屏幕，能迅速抓住每段的心理落点，而且音乐变化有更具体的声音、节奏和情绪对应，细腻度明显更好。Y的优势是叙事解释更充分，人物每次动摇的原因、前后选择的联系交代得更完整，但较长的完整句子在短暂停留的屏幕上增加了阅读负担。综合考虑观看时的即时理解、音乐体验和感受精度，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "419d763b-59a9-42c6-bada-33e8666ba979", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T153404806354Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:34:55.481975+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5806f0f671ec941b6e10962089f84033f8387accbf5148ab7b5033f0d948a2c1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att